      "value": "@{5b7c3929d5fc6b20af6b960a|full_name}: Audio is processed in order, starting with the top component.\n\nPreviously, it was possible to apply effects such as LPF, HPF, etc. to sounds generated by Udon, but the order was changed in a past update and effects can no longer be applied.",
